<title>USA: NatCity Investments wins Kentucky $100 mln TRANs.</title>
<headline>NatCity Investments wins Kentucky $100 mln TRANs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>NatCity Investments Inc. said Thursday it won $100 million Kentucky Interlocal School Transportation Authority tax and revenue anticipation notes.</p>
<p>The true interest cost was 4.09 percent. --U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
